{"type": "excalidraw", "version": 2, "source": "CosmosAI learning export", "elements": [{"id": "title", "type": "text", "x": 60, "y": 40, "width": 960, "height": 40, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 45045001, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 450450011, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1787050000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "a1", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "Milestone 45: Tiny PyTorch Batch Training Proof", "fontSize": 32, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Milestone 45: Tiny PyTorch Batch Training Proof", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": ""}, {"id": "subtitle", "type": "text", "x": 60, "y": 92, "width": 1380, "height": 24, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#495057", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 45045002, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 450450021, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1787050000000, "link": "/learn/concepts/#concept-pytorch-batch", "locked": false, "index": "a2", "hasTextLink": true, "text": "Click boxes for code. Click this subtitle or concept labels for the Obsidian batch concept notes.", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Click boxes for code. Click this subtitle or concept labels for the Obsidian batch concept notes.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": ""}, {"id": "code-flow-heading", "type": "text", "x": 60, "y": 155, "width": 560, "height": 34, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#5f3dc4", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 45045003, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 450450031, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1787050000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "a3", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "1. Code Flow: batch proof before training loop", "fontSize": 24, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "1. Code Flow: batch proof before training loop", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": ""}, {"id": "main-box", "type": "rectangle", "x": 60, "y": 220, "width": 310, "height": 150, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#fff3bf", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 45045004, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 450450041, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1787050000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "a4", "roundness": {"type": 3}}, {"id": "main-text", "type": "text", "x": 82, "y": 245, "width": 260, "height": 100, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 45045005, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 450450051, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1787050000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "a5", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "main()\nCLI orchestrator.\nReads --batch-size,\nloads splits,\nruns proofs,\nprints results.", "fontSize": 17, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "main()\nCLI orchestrator.\nReads --batch-size,\nloads splits,\nruns proofs,\nprints results.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": ""}, {"id": "batch-proof-box", "type": "rectangle", "x": 470, "y": 220, "width": 360, "height": 150, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#d0ebff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 45045006, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 450450061, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1787050000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "a6", "roundness": {"type": 3}}, {"id": "batch-proof-text", "type": "text", "x": 492, "y": 245, "width": 315, "height": 100, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 45045007, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 450450071, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1787050000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "a7", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "run_torch_batch_shape_proof()\nBuilds one preview batch.\nReturns shapes + labels\nso we can inspect the data\nbefore the training loop.", "fontSize": 17, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "run_torch_batch_shape_proof()\nBuilds one preview batch.\nReturns shapes + labels\nso we can inspect the data\nbefore the training loop.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": ""}, {"id": "create-batches-box", "type": "rectangle", "x": 930, "y": 220, "width": 320, "height": 150, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#e5dbff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 45045008, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 450450081, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1787050000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "a8", "roundness": {"type": 3}}, {"id": "create-batches-text", "type": "text", "x": 952, "y": 246, "width": 275, "height": 95, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 45045009, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 450450091, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1787050000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "a9", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "create_sample_batches()\nTurns a list of samples\ninto ordered chunks.\nExample: 2 samples +\nbatch_size=2 -> 1 batch.", "fontSize": 17, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "create_sample_batches()\nTurns a list of samples\ninto ordered chunks.\nExample: 2 samples +\nbatch_size=2 -> 1 batch.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": ""}, {"id": "torch-batch-box", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1350, "y": 220, "width": 390, "height": 150, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#d3f9d8", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 45045010, "version": 2, "versionNonce": 450450101, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1787050000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "a10", "roundness": {"type": 3}}, {"id": "torch-batch-text", "type": "text", "x": 1372, "y": 246, "width": 340, "height": 95, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 45045011, "version": 2, "versionNonce": 450450111, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1787050000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "a11", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "galaxy_samples_to_torch_batch()\nConverts each sample to (1,C,H,W),\nthen stacks them into (N,C,H,W).\nAlso builds label_tensor.", "fontSize": 17, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "galaxy_samples_to_torch_batch()\nConverts each sample to (1,C,H,W),\nthen stacks them into (N,C,H,W).\nAlso builds label_tensor.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": ""}, {"id": "objects-heading", "type": "text", "x": 60, "y": 455, "width": 520, "height": 34, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#5f3dc4", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 45045012, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 450450121, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1787050000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "a12", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "2. Object / tensor shape", "fontSize": 24, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "2. Object / tensor shape", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": ""}, {"id": "sample-list-box", "type": "rectangle", "x": 60, "y": 520, "width": 390, "height": 180, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#fff3bf", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 45045013, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 450450131, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1787050000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "a13", "roundness": {"type": 3}}, {"id": "sample-list-text", "type": "text", "x": 82, "y": 546, "width": 330, "height": 125, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 45045014, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 450450141, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1787050000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "a14", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "list[GalaxyTrainingSample]\n\nsample 0: gz2-000001\nlabel_id = 1 spiral\nsample 1: gz2-000004\nlabel_id = 2 lenticular", "fontSize": 17, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "list[GalaxyTrainingSample]\n\nsample 0: gz2-000001\nlabel_id = 1 spiral\nsample 1: gz2-000004\nlabel_id = 2 lenticular", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": ""}, {"id": "batch-object-box", "type": "rectangle", "x": 600, "y": 520, "width": 470, "height": 180, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#d3f9d8", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 45045015, "version": 2, "versionNonce": 450450151, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1787050000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "a15", "roundness": {"type": 3}}, {"id": "batch-object-text", "type": "text", "x": 622, "y": 545, "width": 420, "height": 130, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 45045016, "version": 2, "versionNonce": 450450161, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1787050000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "a16", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "TorchGalaxyBatch\n\nimage_ids = [gz2-000001, gz2-000004]\nlabels = [spiral, lenticular]\nimage_tensor shape = (2, 3, 3, 3)\nlabel_tensor shape = (2,)", "fontSize": 17, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "TorchGalaxyBatch\n\nimage_ids = [gz2-000001, gz2-000004]\nlabels = [spiral, lenticular]\nimage_tensor shape = (2, 3, 3, 3)\nlabel_tensor shape = (2,)", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": ""}, {"id": "loss-box", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1220, "y": 520, "width": 520, "height": 180, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#ffe3e3", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 45045017, "version": 2, "versionNonce": 450450171, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1787050000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "a17", "roundness": {"type": 3}}, {"id": "loss-text", "type": "text", "x": 1242, "y": 545, "width": 465, "height": 130, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 45045018, "version": 2, "versionNonce": 450450181, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1787050000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "a18", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "TinyGalaxyCNN + CrossEntropyLoss\n\nimage_tensor -> logits shape (2, 4)\nlabel_tensor -> [1, 2]\nloss compares row 0 to label 1\nand row 1 to label 2.\nOne averaged loss updates weights once.", "fontSize": 17, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "TinyGalaxyCNN + CrossEntropyLoss\n\nimage_tensor -> logits shape (2, 4)\nlabel_tensor -> [1, 2]\nloss compares row 0 to label 1\nand row 1 to label 2.\nOne averaged loss updates weights once.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": ""}, {"id": "loop-heading", "type": "text", "x": 60, "y": 790, "width": 640, "height": 34, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#5f3dc4", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 45045019, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 450450191, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1787050000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "a19", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "3. Runtime sequence: what happens over time", "fontSize": 24, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "3. Runtime sequence: what happens over time", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": ""}, {"id": "sequence-box", "type": "rectangle", "x": 60, "y": 855, "width": 1680, "height": 245, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#f8f9fa", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 45045020, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 450450201, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1787050000000, "link": "/learn/concepts/#concept-pytorch-batch", "locked": false, "index": "a20", "roundness": {"type": 3}}, {"id": "sequence-text", "type": "text", "x": 88, "y": 885, "width": 1590, "height": 170, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 45045021, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 450450211, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1787050000000, "link": "/learn/concepts/#concept-pytorch-batch", "locked": false, "index": "a21", "hasTextLink": true, "text": "Command: train_galaxy_cnn_baseline.py ... --epochs 2 --batch-size 2\n\n1. main() loads train/val/test splits.\n2. batch proof prints the first batch shape for learning/debugging.\n3. run_torch_training_loop() creates one model and one optimizer.\n4. Each epoch loops over one train batch containing two images.\n5. Forward pass produces logits for both images.\n6. CrossEntropyLoss averages the two image errors into one loss.\n7. backward() calculates gradients; optimizer.step() updates weights once per batch.\n8. Evaluation and checkpoint reuse the trained loop model.", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Command: train_galaxy_cnn_baseline.py ... --epochs 2 --batch-size 2\n\n1. main() loads train/val/test splits.\n2. batch proof prints the first batch shape for learning/debugging.\n3. run_torch_training_loop() creates one model and one optimizer.\n4. Each epoch loops over one train batch containing two images.\n5. Forward pass produces logits for both images.\n6. CrossEntropyLoss averages the two image errors into one loss.\n7. backward() calculates gradients; optimizer.step() updates weights once per batch.\n8. Evaluation and checkpoint reuse the trained loop model.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": ""}, {"id": "concept-batch-label", "type": "text", "x": 625, "y": 720, "width": 310, "height": 26, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 45045022, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 450450221, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1787050000000, "link": "/learn/concepts/#concept-pytorch-batch", "locked": false, "index": "a22", "hasTextLink": true, "text": "Concept: batch / mini-batch", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Concept: batch / mini-batch", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": ""}, {"id": "concept-loop-label", "type": "text", "x": 1240, "y": 720, "width": 360, "height": 26, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 45045023, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 450450231, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1787050000000, "link": "/learn/concepts/#concept-pytorch-training-loop", "locked": false, "index": "a23", "hasTextLink": true, "text": "Concept: training loop", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Concept: training loop", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": ""}, {"id": "arrow-main-proof", "type": "arrow", "x": 385, "y": 295, "width": 70, "height": 0, "